# Creature tables (emu / genie / type 15 / wyvern) extracted from carpet.exe (see tools/port/gen_exe_tables.py).
# name  ctype  addr  count  # comment
g_type15_dir_weights  u16  0x1ea40  4   # DAT_0001ea40: type15_move_1ef80 copies these to the stack; per candidate heading (yaw, +0x200, +0x400, +0x600) the modulus of the rng draw that scores a passable step: 7000, 7000, 10 (turning back is rarely chosen), 7000
